message: >
  If you use this Agentic Skills Vault in your AI workflows, research, or
  personal projects, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: software
title: "Antigravity Skills Hub: Unified 8-Stage SDLC Agentic Skills Ecosystem"
abstract: >
  A production-grade, interconnected AI agent skills vault designed around an
  8-Stage SDLC lifecycle. Integrates 61 curated skills across Google Antigravity,
  Cursor IDE, Claude Code, and Hermes Agent frameworks through a bidirectional
  Obsidian Knowledge Graph. Features automated dispatch routing, cross-platform
  symlink installation, and a visual Canvas workflow.
